@startuml US005-SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "User" as Actor
participant "UI" as UI
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> UI : selects month and year for Daily History
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/daily-log/history?month={month}&year={year}\nAuthorization: Bearer <access-token>
activate System

System -> System : authenticates user and identifies owner
System -> System : validates month/year against calendar and supported history window
System -> System : derives current date and requested month range
System -> System : retrieves owner's saved logs in requested month\n(excluding today if month is current)
System -> System : calculates each log's nutrition summary from its stored snapshots

alt Logs exist for selected month
    System --> UI : monthly history (dates, meals, foods, quantities, and nutrition summaries)
    UI --> Actor : displays logs newest first, grouped by date and meal
else No logs for selected month
    System --> UI : empty history
    UI --> Actor : displays "No logs are available for this month"
end

deactivate System
deactivate UI
deactivate Actor

note over UI,System
  User identity is derived from the authenticated token.
  currentDate is determined by the application, not supplied by the user.
end note

@enduml
